flowchart TD
    A[HR submits employee details] --> B[Validate request]
    B --> C{Valid and unique?}
    C -- No --> D[Return validation or conflict error]
    C -- Yes --> E[Begin transaction]
    E --> F[Insert employee with generated ID]
    F --> G[Insert initial salary-history row]
    G --> H{Both writes succeed?}
    H -- No --> I[Rollback transaction]
    H -- Yes --> J[Commit and return employee]

    K[HR submits salary and effective date] --> L[Validate request]
    L --> M[Begin transaction / protect against stale update]
    M --> N[Read current salary]
    N --> O[Update current salary]
    O --> P[Append salary-history row]
    P --> Q{Both writes succeed?}
    Q -- No --> R[Rollback transaction]
    Q -- Yes --> S[Commit and return updated salary]
